  {
   "type": "product_header",
   "title": "»genius«",
   "text": "<p>专为模具制造商和磨削企业设计的高精度通用测量机</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ch/%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A/%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC\">立即咨询</a></p>",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/7/csm_genius_header_ef9650a98a.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 1080,
    "h": 930
   },
   "ftype": "zoller_product_header",
   "id": "c2451",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> 我们致力于智能进步 </h2>",
   "body": "<p><strong>品质是刀具制造商和修磨企业的生命线。»genius«通用刀具测量机通过精确的测量数据，为您的产品品质提供保证。 </strong></p> <p>借助 ZOLLER »genius«，您可对精密刀具的 100 多个参数进行 2D/3D 非接触式测量，该过程全自动且精准可靠。每个测量值都是您提升产品品质的坚实基础。</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ch/%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A/%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC\">立即咨询</a> <a href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 专家对话</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/9/csm_genius_detail_01_b7031e041c.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c785",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "",
   "body": "<p>使用经认证的测试样件和参考标准，对测量设备进行现场校准，是 E. ZOLLER GmbH &amp; Co. KG 质量保证体系中的重要环节。借此，我们确保测量结果的可靠性，并保障您的产品符合适用标准的高精度要求。</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/7/csm_zertifizierung_de_ba3758917f.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1699,
     "h": 539
    }
   ],
